{"id": 3411, "name": "Minong Wild River Trail Campground", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://villageofminong.org/village-of-minong-wild-river-trail-rv-park-campground/", "lines": ["re immediately accessible to the Wild Rivers Trail and Washburn County ATV Trail network. There are 20 R.V. campsites with full hookups (electric, water, and sewer) and 5 tent sites without electricity. Camping fees are $45.00 per night for R.V. sites and $20.00 per night for non-electric tent sites. | This campground caters to RV campers as well as ATV enthusiasts and is available for all camping interests. Other ca"]}, {"url": "https://villageofminong.org/", "lines": [], "via": "Village Contact Information & Services"}, {"url": "https://villageofminong.org/services/", "lines": [], "via": "Police, Fire & EMS Services"}, {"url": "https://villageofminong.org/2019/01/03/agenda-october-3rd-2016-at-600-p-m/", "lines": [], "via": "All Agendas- Village of Minong Corporate Board Meetings"}, {"url": "https://villageofminong.org/2019/01/01/reg-board-meeting-august-2015/", "lines": [], "via": "Minutes – Village of Minong Corporate Board Meeting"}, {"url": "https://www.washburncountyparks.us/parks/", "lines": []}, {"url": "https://www.washburncountyparks.us/parks/camping/", "lines": ["lity | | | | | Totogatic Park offers 107 campsites on the 1600-acre Minong Flowage. This park is a popular destination for those seeking water based recreation, including boating, fishing and swimming. Camping rates are $35 per night for sites with full hookups, $30 per night for sites with water and electric hookups, $25 per night for sites with electric hookups and $20 per night for sites with no hookups. Sites may", "ecreation, including boating, fishing and swimming. Camping rates are $35 per night for sites with full hookups, $30 per night for sites with water and electric hookups, $25 per night for sites with electric hookups and $20 per night for sites with no hookups. Sites may be reserved 335 days in advance (generally 11 months) | | | | | | | | | Sawmill Park View Details | | | | Availability | | | | | Sawmill Park is a pe", "on for those seeking a quiet and relaxing campging atmosphere. This smaller, 25 unit, campground sits on the 16 acre Sawmill Lake. There are no electric campsites, due to Sawmill's wilderness location. Camping rates are $10.00/night for each camping unit. | | | | | | | | | Minong - Wild River Trail ATV Campground View Details | | | | Availability | | | | | Minong - ATV/RV Campground,operated by the Village of Minong,", " unit. | | | | | | | | | Minong - Wild River Trail ATV Campground View Details | | | | Availability | | | | | Minong - ATV/RV Campground,operated by the Village of Minong, was newly constructed in 2013. Camping fees are $45.00 per night for R.V. full hookup sites and $20.00 per night for non-electric sites. | | | | | | | | | Shell Lake Municipal Campground View Details | | | | Availability | | | | | Shell Lake Munici"], "via": ""}, {"url": "https://www.washburncountyparks.us/parks/reservation/", "lines": [], "via": "My Pending Reservations"}]}
