{"id": 3461, "name": "Dalrymple Park and Campground", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.cityofbayfield.com/dalrymple-campground.html", "lines": ["sure to clearly post your arrival and departure dates at your campsite, and double check that the dates are correct, so that it is clear to other campers that your site is occupied. ​Open mid-May to mid-October | Rates: $30.00 per site * NO REFUNDS * | Sorry, No Reservations , so come early and stay longer!! We have 34 rustic tent and RV Sites overlooking Lake Superior | We don't recommend RVs larger than 25 feet | L", "private sites | | Apostle Islands lookout points | Near all area attractions | Electrical hookups ​ | Vault toilets | No showers Showers are available at the Bayfield Recreation Center for a fee ( day passes available - $10/adult or $25/family) . Please visit www.bayfieldrec.org for more information about all the amenities they offer! | | No subleasing campsites | 2 tents/site, or 1 RV/site | No on-site dump station "]}, {"url": "https://www.cityofbayfield.com/emergency-services.html", "lines": [], "via": "Emergency Services"}, {"url": "https://www.cityofbayfield.com/historic-preservation-commission.html", "lines": [], "via": "Historic Preservation Commission"}, {"url": "https://www.cityofbayfield.com/uploads/1/1/1/5/11158030/dalrymple_campground_brocure_updated_25.pdf", "pdf": true, "via": "Brochure"}]}
