{"id": 3481, "name": "Brown County Fairgrounds", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.browncountywi.gov/community/parks-department/general-information/camping/", "lines": ["s made on Memorial, Labor, and Independence Day (holiday) require 3 or more nights A tent or camper must be present on the first night of all first-come, first-serve site reservations. | | Fees : Water & Electric Sites: $34/night Rustic Sites (no hookups): $22/night Group Camp: Site #300 - $55/night, Site #301 - $80/night Dump Station for non-registered campers: $15/use Typically, the campground is open April - Octob", "st-come, first-serve site reservations. | | Fees : Water & Electric Sites: $34/night Rustic Sites (no hookups): $22/night Group Camp: Site #300 - $55/night, Site #301 - $80/night Dump Station for non-registered campers: $15/use Typically, the campground is open April - October (weather pending). | | Campground Map | Current First Come, First Serve Site Availability | Park Map - link coming soon | Site Details (length", " facilities (registered campers only) RV dump station Free WIFI available Fees : | Camper registration fees for the remainder of 2026 will be made through an envelope system and will only accept cash or check. All sites $34/night A special event RV parking/camping rate of $70 per day is in effect for any Lambeau Field event (games, concerts, etc). This fee is applied for the day before and the day of any special even", "the day of any special event. For free bus shuttling to Lambeau Field, check out the City of Green Bay’s Game Day Routes (the Fairgrounds is located on the Quick Slant Route). RV dump station for non-registered campers: $15/use Brown County Fairgrounds Availability Calendar | Camping will not be available on the below 2026 dates. Please check back within two weeks of your camping plans to confirm availability has not", "t be available on the below 2026 dates. Please check back within two weeks of your camping plans to confirm availability has not changed. October 20-October 21 November 16-December 31 | Special Event RV Parking/Camping, $70 per night during the below listed 2026 special event dates: October 10-October 11 October 17–October 18 October 28–October 29 November 14–November 15 Campground Map | | Reforestation Camp Campgrou", " more nights Reservations made Friday – Saturday (weekend) require 2 or more nights Reservations made on Memorial, Labor, and Independence Day (holiday) require 3 or more nights Fee : Rustic and tent sites (no hookups): $22/night Water & Electric: $34/night Full hookups: $44/night Group Camp: $55/night Campground Map Park Map | Reforestation Camp Site Details (lengths & amps) - link coming soon | | | | Campground Spe"]}, {"url": "https://www.browncountywi.gov/government/county_board/", "lines": [], "via": "- County Board of Supervisors"}, {"url": "https://www.bchumanservices.com/", "lines": [], "via": "- Community Services"}, {"url": "https://www.bchumanservices.com/adult-services/criminal-justice-services/", "lines": [], "via": "- Criminal Justice Services"}, {"url": "https://www.bchumanservices.com/", "lines": [], "via": "- Health & Human Services"}]}
