{"id": 3503, "name": "Pine Point County Park", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.chippewacountywi.gov/government/facilities-parks-division/parks", "error": "<HTTPError 404: 'Not Found'>"}, {"url": "https://reservations.chippewacountywi.gov/parks/camping/pine_point_campground/", "lines": ["grounds » Pine Point Campground | | | | | Pine Point Campground Parks Open until 10/31/26 - All Sites First Come, First Served - More Details | | | Make A Reservation | | | | Interactive Map | | | | | Pricing: Sites are $20.00 per night Electricity is $7.00 per night (optional, but available at all sites and the pavilion) 20-30-50 amp electricity is now installed on all sites at all parks. Dock Sites are $5.00 additi", "ap | | | | | Pricing: Sites are $20.00 per night Electricity is $7.00 per night (optional, but available at all sites and the pavilion) 20-30-50 amp electricity is now installed on all sites at all parks. Dock Sites are $5.00 additional per night Pavilion is $15.00 per day (electricity is available, see above for fee) Showers are coin operated (quarters only please): $1.50 for 6 minutes with each minute after an addi", "lectricity is now installed on all sites at all parks. Dock Sites are $5.00 additional per night Pavilion is $15.00 per day (electricity is available, see above for fee) Showers are coin operated (quarters only please): $1.50 for 6 minutes with each minute after an additional ¢25. Only United States currency is accepted. | Camping Season: Pine Point campground is generally open from the first week in May through the ", "ion of County Highway M and Highway 27. | Main Restroom & Shower Facility by Playground | | North Bathroom Across from Sites 20-26 | | Pine Point campground has a sanitary dump station located in the large parking lot - $2 for park guests, $6 for visitors. | Firewood House & Dispenser | Firewood is available from the caretaker for $6.00 or through the dispenser for $6.50. | NO ATV'S/UTV'S, GOLF CARTS, OR OTHER UNAUTH", "mpground has a sanitary dump station located in the large parking lot - $2 for park guests, $6 for visitors. | Firewood House & Dispenser | Firewood is available from the caretaker for $6.00 or through the dispenser for $6.50. | NO ATV'S/UTV'S, GOLF CARTS, OR OTHER UNAUTHORIZED VEHICLES ALLOWED IN ANY PART OF THE DAY PARKS OR CAMPGROUNDS OR IN THE RESIDENTIAL AREA OFF OF COUNTY HIGHWAY M. | | | | Playground | For Hol", "d campground guests. A beach with swimming area, playground equipment, picnic pavilion, grills, and picnic tables are all available for your enjoyment! The pavilion at Pine Point is available for reservation per day for $15.00 without electricity and $22.00 with the electric turned on. Pavilion building measures 35’ x 25’ and holds approximately 75 people. The pavilion includes picnic tables and garbage cans. Picture", " Pine Point Park Campground Map | | | | | Chippewa County Reservation Policy | | | | | Cancellation Policy | | | | Cancellation Policy: Cancellations must be completed at least 10 days in-advance of park arrival date! A $15 fee, per cancellation, will be charged. For security reasons, there is a 24 hour waiting period after the reservation has been made. | Check-In : 0) { cLS = Layer('sites').options[Layer('sites').s"]}, {"url": "https://reservations.chippewacountywi.gov/parks/camping/", "lines": [], "via": ""}, {"url": "https://reservations.chippewacountywi.gov/parks/camping/", "lines": [], "via": "- Camping Reservations"}, {"url": "https://reservations.chippewacountywi.gov/parks/pavilions/", "lines": [], "via": "- Pavilion Reservations"}, {"url": "https://reservations.chippewacountywi.gov/parks/camping/pine_point_campground/sites/", "lines": [], "via": "Make A Reservation"}]}
