 | Availability | | | | | Sawmill Park is a pe", "on for those seeking a quiet and relaxing campging atmosphere. This smaller, 25 unit, campground sits on the 16 acre Sawmill Lake. There are no electric campsites, due to Sawmill's wilderness location. Camping rates are $10.00/night for each camping unit. | | | | | | | | | Minong - Wild River Trail ATV Campground View Details | | | | Availability | | | | | Minong - ATV/RV Campground,operated by the Village of Minong,", " unit. | | | | | | | | | Minong - Wild River Trail ATV Campground View Details | | | | Availability | | | | | Minong - ATV/RV Campground,operated by the Village of Minong, was newly constructed in 2013. Camping fees are $45.00 per night for R.V. full hookup sites and $20.00 per night for non-electric sites. | | | | | | | | | Shell Lake Municipal Campground View Details | | | | Availability | | | | | Shell Lake Munici"], "via": ""}, {"url": "https://www.washburncountyparks.us/parks/reservation/", "lines": [], "via": "My Pending Reservations"}, {"url": "https://www.washburncountyparks.us/parks/camping/totogatic_park/sites/", "lines": [], "via": "Find A Campsite"}, {"url": "https://www.washburncountyparks.us/parks/camping/totogatic_park/availability/", "lines": [], "via": "Availability"}]}
