{"id": 3542, "name": "Morris-Erickson County Park", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://reservations.chippewacountywi.gov/parks/camping/morriserickson_campground/", "lines": ["Morris-Erickson Campground | | | | | Morris-Erickson Campground Parks Open until 10/31/26 - All Sites First Come, First Served - More Details | | | Make A Reservation | | | | Interactive Map | | | | | Pricing: Sites are $20.00 per night Electricity is an additional $7.00 per night (optional, but available at all sites and the shelter) 20-30-50 amp electricity is now installed on all sites at all parks. Docks are avai", "00 per night Electricity is an additional $7.00 per night (optional, but available at all sites and the shelter) 20-30-50 amp electricity is now installed on all sites at all parks. Docks are available for an additional $5.00 per night from the caretaker. There are 5, double-sided docks available for campers. Only site 9 has a designated dock. Shelter is $15.00 per day (electricity is available, see above for fee). O", " is now installed on all sites at all parks. Docks are available for an additional $5.00 per night from the caretaker. There are 5, double-sided docks available for campers. Only site 9 has a designated dock. Shelter is $15.00 per day (electricity is available, see above for fee). Only United States currency is accepted. | Camping Seaso n: Morris-Erickson campground is generally open from the first week in May throug", "d is behind the bathrooms and features a grassy area with benches. | | | Swings are located closer to the picnic area. Morris-Erickson has a sanitary dump station located inside the campground by the small parking lot | $2 for park guests, $6 for visitors. | Sanitary Dump Station | A smal parking lot is located behind the dump station for overnight camping guests only. | Firewood House and Dispenser | Firewood is ava", " guests, $6 for visitors. | Sanitary Dump Station | A smal parking lot is located behind the dump station for overnight camping guests only. | Firewood House and Dispenser | Firewood is available from the caretakers for $6.00 or from the dispenser for $6.50. | | | Docks are located by the picnic area/entrance to the campground. See the caretaker for renting. | | | For information on Long Lake from the Wisconsin Depar", "nd campground guests. A beach with swimming area, playground equipment, picnic shelter, grills, picnic tables are all available for your enjoyment! The shelter at Morris-Erickson is available for reservation per day for $15.00 without electricity and $22.00 with the electric turned on. The shelter building measures 23’ x 25’ and holds approximately 50 people. The shelter includes picnic tables and garbage cans with g", "-Erickson Park Campground Map | | | | | Chippewa County Reservation Policy | | | | | Cancellation Policy | | | | Cancellation Policy: Cancellations must be completed at least 10 days in-advance of park arrival date! | A $15 fee, per cancellation, will be charged. | For security reasons, there is a 24 hour waiting period after the reservation has been made. | Check-In : 0) { cLS = Layer('sites').options[Layer('sites')"]}, {"url": "https://reservations.chippewacountywi.gov/parks/camping/", "lines": [], "via": ""}, {"url": "https://reservations.chippewacountywi.gov/parks/camping/", "lines": [], "via": "- Camping Reservations"}, {"url": "https://reservations.chippewacountywi.gov/parks/pavilions/", "lines": [], "via": "- Pavilion Reservations"}, {"url": "https://reservations.chippewacountywi.gov/parks/camping/morriserickson_campground/sites/", "lines": [], "via": "Make A Reservation"}]}
