{"id": 3547, "name": "Hatfield City Park", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.newrichmondwi.gov/departments/public_works/parks___trails/campground_reservations.php", "lines": ["end of New Richmond near the intersection of Highways 64 and 65 at 1321 Jerry Frey Drive. This seasonal campground is open May 1 through October 15 and offers a convenient, family-friendly place to stay. | Campsites are $35 per night, with a monthly rate of $900. Sites 1–16 include full hookups with water, sewer, and 50-amp electric. Sites 17–20 offer electric-only service. Free Wi-Fi for casual use is available thro", "oon or later, and check-out must be completed by 11:00 a.m. When reserving your site, please select only the nights you plan to stay and do not include your departure date. | A dump station is available at this site for $10 per use for those not staying at the campground. | To reserve a campsite, click on the link below. | | Hatfield Campground Reservation Link | If you have questions or need additional information, "]}, {"url": "https://www.newrichmondwi.gov/departments/public_works/parks___trails/Departments/Clerk/2026 Fee Schedule (for web).pdf", "error": "InvalidURL(\"URL can't contain control characters. '/departments/public_works/parks___trails/Departments/Clerk/2026 Fee Schedule (for web).pdf' (found at least '"}, {"url": "https://www.newrichmondwi.gov/departments/public_works/parks___trails/Community/cemetery/Fees cemetery_fees(2).pdf", "error": "InvalidURL(\"URL can't contain control characters. '/departments/public_works/parks___trails/Community/cemetery/Fees cemetery_fees(2).pdf' (found at least ' ')\")"}, {"url": "https://www.newrichmondwi.gov/departments/public_works/parks___trails/departments/public_works/parks___trails/campground_reservations.php", "error": "<HTTPError 404: 'Not Found'>"}, {"url": "https://www.newrichmondwi.gov/departments/public_works/parks___trails/community/shared_ride_taxi_service.php", "error": "<HTTPError 404: 'Not Found'