{"id": 3548, "name": "Morgan Park", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.marinettecountywi.gov/parks/camping/morgan_park_campground/", "lines": [" | | | | | | | | | | | | | | Campgrounds » Morgan Park Campground | | | | ATV/UTV Usage in Marinette County Parks - More Details | | | Credit Card Fee | There is a 2.5% convenience fee for all credit card transactions. ($2.00 minimum) | | | Morgan Park Campground Find A Campsite | | | | Interactive Map | | | | | | | | | | Morgan Park Campground provides 45 electric campsites on Timms Lake in northeastern Marinette Co", "trails, and a stunning overlook. An enclosed day use lodge and a group site are also available. Reservations available 184 days in advance. | | Marinette County Visitor Guides and Waterfall Map | | Fees: Electric Sites: $35.00/night per site except for Tuesday & Wednesday which is $30.00/night per site Reservation Fee: $10.00/site non-refundable Firewood: $7.00/bundle Dump Station: Included ($20.00 fee for non-regist", ". | | Marinette County Visitor Guides and Waterfall Map | | Fees: Electric Sites: $35.00/night per site except for Tuesday & Wednesday which is $30.00/night per site Reservation Fee: $10.00/site non-refundable Firewood: $7.00/bundle Dump Station: Included ($20.00 fee for non-registered campers) Two vehicle stickers included with camping fee Additional vehicles/non-campers $5.00 day use Annual Park Vehicle Stickers ar", "t per site Reservation Fee: $10.00/site non-refundable Firewood: $7.00/bundle Dump Station: Included ($20.00 fee for non-registered campers) Two vehicle stickers included with camping fee Additional vehicles/non-campers $5.00 day use Annual Park Vehicle Stickers are $25.00 per year Opens: May 1 | Closes: November 30 | | Important note: Depending on any early freezing temps (32 degrees or below), any time after Oct. 1", "e held for the length of the reservation unless the Parks Office is notified of the cancellation. Failure to notify the Parks Office during re