{"id": 3555, "name": "Peshtigo Badger Park Campground", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://ci.peshtigo.wi.gov/badger-park/", "lines": ["| Badger Park Campground Brochure | Badger Park Campground Area includes: | 35 campsites and 2 cabins. All with water and electric. | 4 rustic tent sites. | 1 group site (up to four campers) | Campsite Rates (NO SEWER): $35/night, $210/week, $840/one month, no seasonal | Campsite Rates (WITH SEWER): $40/night, $240/week, $960/month, $2,090/seasonal | Cabin Rates: $50/night, $300/week (one week max) | Walk-in Tent sit", "t sites. | 1 group site (up to four campers) | Campsite Rates (NO SEWER): $35/night, $210/week, $840/one month, no seasonal | Campsite Rates (WITH SEWER): $40/night, $240/week, $960/month, $2,090/seasonal | Cabin Rates: $50/night, $300/week (one week max) | Walk-in Tent sites Rates : (no hook-ups): $15/night, $90/week | Group Site: $75 per night for the site – up to 4 campers | During May-October, please call 715-582", "ment required when reservation is made. | Cash and check payments accepted. Credit cards accepted, with an added fee. | Cancellations: | Reservation cancellation 7 days before check in: payment will be refunded, minus a $10 service fee. | Reservation cancellation less than 7 days before check in: payment will not be refunded unless the site is rebooked. If so, refund will be in the form of a camping voucher to be use", "vice fee. | Reservation cancellation less than 7 days before check in: payment will not be refunded unless the site is rebooked. If so, refund will be in the form of a camping voucher to be used within one year, minus a $10 service fee. | Any refund will be by check, 4-6 weeks for delivery. | Reservation payments made for holiday weekends (Memorial Day, July 4th, Labor Day) and Peshtigo Historical Day weekend will no", "a | Disc Golf – a challenging 9 hole course | (Discs are available from the Campground Office, when staffed, but it is recommended you bring your own disc