{"id": 3557, "name": "Chain-O-Lakes Campground", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.cityofphillips.com/campground.html", "lines": ["yet in a quiet area nestled to the east of the city. All campsites have electric. Potable water is available at the building which houses the bathrooms and coin-operated showers (that take quarters). The nightly rate is $30 per campsite. Campsites are first come, first served and cannot be reserved. Contact the City at 715-339-3125 for more information. City of Phillips' Chain-O-Lakes Campground The Chain-O-Lakes Cam", "et in a quiet area nestled to the east of the city. All campsites have electric. Potable water is available at the building which houses the bathrooms and coin- operated showers (that take quarters). The nightly rate is $30 per campsite. Campsites are first come, first served and cannot be reserved. Contact the City at 715-339-3125 for more information. | Bohn Web Design Copyright © 2006 to Present. All rights reserv"]}]}
