{"id": 3570, "name": "Shell Lake Municipal Campground", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "http://www.shelllake.org/where-to-stay/", "lines": []}, {"url": "http://www.shelllake.org/find-your-fun/shopping/", "lines": [], "via": "Shopping & Services"}, {"url": "http://www.shelllake.org/business/shell-lake-atv-campground/", "lines": [], "via": "Shell Lake ATV Campground"}, {"url": "http://www.shelllake.org/business/shell-lake-municipal-campground-2/", "lines": [], "via": "Campground"}, {"url": "http://www.shelllake.org/city-of-shell-lake-lead-service-line-inventory-map/", "lines": [], "via": "City of Shell Lake Lead Service Line Inventory Map"}, {"url": "https://www.washburncountyparks.us/parks/camping/shell_lake_municipal_campground/", "lines": ["ps (sites #1 - #38) 47 sites (12 on the lake) Clean, hot showers RV Dump station 12 pull-thru sites (sites #13 - #24) Boat dock available for daily rentals (campground patrons only) Public swim beach Public boat launch ($10 daily/$30 yearly) Fish cleaning station Hospital Nearby (Indianhead Medical Center) NOTE: Water services may be suspended at all sites and restroom facilities once the weather gets cooler to preve"]}, {"url": "https://www.washburncountyparks.us/parks/camping/", "lines": ["lity | | | | | Totogatic Park offers 107 campsites on the 1600-acre Minong Flowage. This park is a popular destination for those seeking water based recreation, including boating, fishing and swimming. Camping rates are $35 per night for sites with full hookups, $30 per night for sites with water and electric hookups, $25 per night for sites with electric hookups and $20 per night for sites with no hookups. Sites may", "ecreation, including boating, fishing and swimming. Camping rates are $35 per night for sites with full hookups, $30 per night for sites with water and electric hookups, $25 per night for sites with electric hookups and $20 per night for sites with no hookups. Sites may be reserved 335 days in advance (generally 11 months) | | | | | | | | | Sawmill Park View Details | | | | Availability | | | | | Sawmill Park is a pe", "on for those seeking a quiet and relaxing campging atmosphere. This smaller, 25 unit, campground sits on the 16 acre Sawmill Lake. There are no electric campsites, due to Sawmill's wilderness location. Camping rates are $10.00/night for each camping unit. | | | | | | | | | Minong - Wild River Trail ATV Campground View Details | | | | Availability | | | | | Minong - ATV/RV Campground,operated by the Village of Minong,", " unit. | | | | | | | | | Minong - Wild River Trail ATV Campground View Details | | | | Availability | | | | | Minong - ATV/RV Campground,operated by the Village of Minong, was newly constructed in 2013. Camping fees are $45.00 per night for R.V. full hookup sites and $20.00 per night for non-electric sites. | | | | | | | | | Shell Lake Municipal Campground View Details | | | | Availability | | | | | Shell Lake Munici"], "via": ""}, {"url": "https://www.washburncountyparks.us/parks/reservation/", "lines": [], "via": "My Pending Reservations"}, {"url": "https://www.washburncountyparks.us/parks/camping/shell_lake_municipal_campground/sites/", "lines": [], "via": "Find A Campsite"}, {"url": "https://www.washburncountyparks.us/parks/camping/shell_lake_municipal_campground/availability/", "lines": [], "via": "Availability"}]}
{"id": 3571, "name": "Beauford T. Anderson Campground", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://soldiersgrove.municipalimpact.com/beauford-t-anderson-campground", "lines": ["d at the Village Office Monday-Friday 7:30 am to 4:00 pm or at Campbell's One Stop(Mobil). | We now offer WIFI to all campers. | There are men's and women's bathrooms with showers available to campers. | Electric sites: $25.00, Non-electric sites: $23.00, and tents: $12.00 | | Camping Ordinance: | Chapter 82. Camping | Article I. Beauford T. Anderson Park | [Adopted 4-7-2022 by Ord. No. 2022-02 ] § 82-1. General prov", "be posted informing persons of the provisions of this section. § 82-4. Violations and penalties. | Any person who fails to comply with the provisions of this article shall, upon conviction thereof, forfeit not more than $200 and costs of prosecution for each violation and in default of payment of such forfeiture and costs, shall be imprisoned in the County Jail until payment thereof, but not exceeding 30 days. § 82-5", "r the condition of the camping unit. The Village is not responsible for damage to the camping unit caused by its removal from the campground. The camper shall pay the Village's expenses to remove the unit, a flat fee of $150 and monthly storage costs of $100. § 82-6. Charge for nonremoval. | There shall be a charge of $25 per day for nonremoval of a camping unit on or before the date on which the camping unit should "]}, {"url": "https://soldiersgrove.municipalimpact.com/emergency-services", "lines": [], "via": "Emergency Services"}, {"url": "https://soldiersgrove.municipalimpact.com/water-sewer-rates-and-policies", "lines": [], "via": "Water/Sewer Rates & Policies"}, {"url": "https://soldiersgrove.municipalimpact.com/dining-and-lodging", "lines": [], "via": "Dining & Lodging"}, {"url": "https://soldiersgrove.municipalimpact.com/campbell-s-one-stop", "lines": [], "via": "Campbell's One Stop"}]}
{"id": 3572, "name": "Lucius Woods County Park", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.douglascountywi.gov/650/Campgrounds", "lines": ["oat launch with excellent fishing opportunities, newer vault toilets, picnic and grill areas. Mooney Dam is located on Lower Eau Claire Lake, 13 miles east of Gordon on County Road Y. | | Camping Rates: | Electric site: $25.00/night | Electric & Water site: $30.00/night | Non-electric site: $20.00/night | Firewood: $5.00/armload | Groups of more than 5: Additional $2.00/person | Off-Season Camping: Not available. | |", "les east of Gordon on County Road Y. | | Camping Rates: | Electric site: $25.00/night | Electric & Water site: $30.00/night | Non-electric site: $20.00/night | Firewood: $5.00/armload | Groups of more than 5: Additional $2.00/person | Off-Season Camping: Not available. | | Mooney Dam County Park Brochure | Printed brochures are available by contacting the Forestry Department. | Gordon Dam County Park | ( location map", "| The park is located at the headwaters of the St. Croix Scenic River, seven miles west of Gordon on County Road Y, which is approximately 37 miles south of Superior on US Highway 53. | | Camping Rates: | Electric site: $25.00/night | Electric & Water site: $30.00/night | Non-electric site: $20.00/night | Firewood: $5.00/armload | Groups of more than 5: Additional $2.00/person | Off-Season Camping: | Offered followin", " south of Superior on US Highway 53. | | Camping Rates: | Electric site: $25.00/night | Electric & Water site: $30.00/night | Non-electric site: $20.00/night | Firewood: $5.00/armload | Groups of more than 5: Additional $2.00/person | Off-Season Camping: | Offered following the standard and extended camping season until snow covers the road on a first-come, first-served, self-registration basis. Upper restrooms are o", "s road serves as a winter snowmobile trail during the winter months and is actively groomed for snowmobile use. Use of the road during this time of year by highway vehicles is prohibited. | | Off-Season Camping Rates: | $20.00/night at any site. Electric will remain on during off-season. | | Gordon Dam Park Brochure | Printed brochures are available by contacting the Douglas County Forestry Department. | | | Lucius W", "kdrop for the performances on Saturday evenings throughout the summer. The schedule changes annually. To view a schedule of the concerts, visit Lucius Woods Performing Arts Center . | | Camping Rates: | | Electric site: $25.00/night | Electric & Water site: $30.00/night | Non-electric site: $20.00/night | Firewood: $5.00/armload | Groups of more than 5: Additional $2.00/person | Off-Season Camping: Not available. | |", "ius Woods Performing Arts Center . | | Camping Rates: | | Electric site: $25.00/night | Electric & Water site: $30.00/night | Non-electric site: $20.00/night | Firewood: $5.00/armload | Groups of more than 5: Additional $2.00/person | Off-Season Camping: Not available. | | Lucius Woods County Park Brochure | Printed brochures are available by contacting the Douglas County Forestry Department. | Reservation Policy | R", "ason Camping: Not available. | | Lucius Woods County Park Brochure | Printed brochures are available by contacting the Douglas County Forestry Department. | Reservation Policy | Reservations | | Include a non-refundable $5.00 Reservation Service Fee in addition to the camping fee. | | Campsites in all 3 campgrounds may be reserved in advance for the Standard Season (from two Fridays before Memorial Day to Monday afte"]}, {"url": "https://www.douglascountywi.gov/223/Campgrounds-Parks", "lines": [], "via": "Campgrounds & Parks"}, {"url": "https://www.douglascountywi.gov/1258/Update-Campground-Reservation", "lines": ["Home | Departments | Forestry, Parks & Recreation | Outdoor Recreation | Campgrounds & Parks | Update Campground Reservation | Update Campground Reservation | RESERVATION POLICY | RESERVATIONS | Include a non-refundable $5.00 Reservation Service Fee in addition to the camping fee. | Campsites in all 3 campgrounds may be reserved in advance for the Standard Season (from two Fridays before Memorial Day to Monday after "], "via": "Update Campground Reservation"}, {"url": "https://online.premiercampground.com/92a3dc1a12394485a40e8b8e2db73fb3", "lines": []}]}
{"id": 3573, "name": "Otter Lake County Park", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://gochippewacounty.com/listings/otter-lake-county-park/", "error": "<HTTPError 403: 'Forbidden'>"}, {"url": "https://reservations.chippewacountywi.gov/parks/camping/otter_lake_campground/", "lines": ["losed 10/15/2026 | The porta potty at the Otter Lake east boat launch off of 170th Avenue will be closed on October 15th for the 2026 season. | | | Make A Reservation | | | | Interactive Map | | | | | Pricing: Sites are $20.00 per night Electricity is $7.00 per night (optional, but available at all sites and the pavilion) Dock Sites are $5.00 additional per night Large Pavilion: $15.00 from 9 AM to 3PM or 3 PM to 9PM", "tion | | | | Interactive Map | | | | | Pricing: Sites are $20.00 per night Electricity is $7.00 per night (optional, but available at all sites and the pavilion) Dock Sites are $5.00 additional per night Large Pavilion: $15.00 from 9 AM to 3PM or 3 PM to 9PM (electricity is available, see above for fee) Small Pavilion: $15.00 per day (electricity is available, see above for fee). Only United States currency is accept", "g | Otter Lake campground has a fill station, but does not have a sanitary dump. | There are limited extra parking spots in the Campground. | ​ | Firewood House & Dispenser | Firewood is available from the caretaker for $6.00 per rick (wheelbarrow full). Or for $9.00 from the Firewood Dispenser located on site (note, lockers contain a larger amount of wood). | | Flushing restroom and shower house! | The campground ha", "und are available for all guests to use. The day park also has boat launch, large and small picnic pavilion, grills, and picnic tables The shelters at Otter Lake Day Park are available for reservation. The rental fee is $15.00 without electricity and $22.00 with the electric turned on. The day-use area is gated and locked at 9 pm daily, so please be prepared to exit promptly. Wonderful pictures from some of our favor", " Otter Lake Park Campground Map | | | | | Chippewa County Reservation Policy | | | | | Cancellation Policy | | | | Cancellation Policy: Cancellations must be completed at least 10 days in-advance of park arrival date! A $15 fee, per cancellation, will be charged. For security reasons, there is a 24 hour waiting period after the reservation has been made. | Check-In : 0) { cLS = Layer('sites').options[Layer('sites').s"]}, {"url": "https://reservations.chippewacountywi.gov/parks/camping/", "lines": [], "via": ""}, {"url": "https://reservations.chippewacountywi.gov/parks/camping/", "lines": [], "via": "- Camping Reservations"}, {"url": "https://reservations.chippewacountywi.gov/parks/pavilions/", "lines": [], "via": "- Pavilion Reservations"}, {"url": "https://reservations.chippewacountywi.gov/parks/camping/otter_lake_campground/sites/", "lines": [], "via": "Make A Reservation"}]}
